{"overview":"در طول آغاز سال‌های رکود بزرگ، زندگی در دریای مدیترانه و سواحل اطراف آن بسیار دشوار شده بود. غارت و تاخت و تاز دزدان هوایی بسیار زیاد شده، بنابراین به وجود محافظان ماهر نیاز است. یک از بهترین محافظان یک خوک بنام «پورکو روسو» است که زمانی انسان و یک خلبان درجه یک در زمان جنگ جهانی اول بوده است او حالا به کسانی که دچار تنگدستی شده‌اند بدون هیچ گونه چشمداشتی کمک می‌کند...","tagline":"","overview_en":"In Italy in the 1930s, sky pirates in biplanes terrorize wealthy cruise ships as they sail the Adriatic Sea. The only pilot brave enough to stop the scourge is the mysterious Porco Rosso, a former World War I flying ace who was somehow turned into a pig during the war. As he prepares to battle the pirate crew's American ace, Porco Rosso enlists the help of spunky girl mechanic Fio Piccolo and his longtime friend Madame Gina.","tagline_en":"Can a pig really fly?","runtime":93,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["هایائو میازاکی"],"crew_en":["Hayao Miyazaki"],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"森山周一郎","role":"Kurenai no Buta (voice)","photo":"/dEvbRkdUknnNcjIh2yyXJXm7uIO.jpg","en":"Shūichirō Moriyama"},{"name":"توکیکو کاتو","role":"Jina-sama (voice)","photo":"/gEJE4cpBpGS1rq93qIwrmQ5duM8.jpg","en":"Tokiko Kato"},{"name":"Bunshi Katsura Vi","role":"Pikkoro-oyaji (voice)","photo":"/nndJZXsxHqRPor6K8KZicUjMZgE.jpg","en":"Bunshi Katsura VI"},{"name":"上條恒彦","role":"Manmayuto no shachô (voice)","photo":"/v2poQi0qYEWdTaMf2pVTWmcdwZp.jpg","en":"Tsunehiko Kamijô"},{"name":"آکمی اوکامورا","role":"Fio Pikkoro (voice)","photo":"/qEwVfsrA23SCzRZMSlghw2sHctQ.jpg","en":"Akemi Okamura"},{"name":"大塚明夫","role":"Donarudo Kâchisu (voice)","photo":"/uH9oiqOOgrsz2zNnouVZ1qPzDyb.jpg","en":"Akio Otsuka"},{"name":"関弘子","role":"Bâ-chan (voice)","photo":"/qT2lS6TuQIJkjJiReYFziXnpH9L.jpg","en":"Hiroko Seki"},{"name":"野本礼三","role":"Mamma Aiuto Gang (voice)","photo":"/4kdO7dnvRcYGN6ByGpB3esva1fY.jpg","en":"Reizō Nomoto"},{"name":"阪脩","role":"Mamma Aiuto Gang (voice)","pho